{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-villa-del-gavi","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"villa-del-gavi-mr-eight-development-dubai-islands","about":"Located on the iconic Dubai Islands, Villa Del Gavi introduces a new chapter of waterfront sophistication. Developed by Mr. Eight, a name synonymous with refined European craftsmanship, the project features 2, 3, and 4-bedroom residences in simplex and duplex formats. Designed for modern families who appreciate both privacy and grandeur, homes at Villa Del Gavi by Mr. Eight Development include ceiling heights of up to 6.7 meters, natural Italian finishes, and panoramic views of the Arabian Gulf.The development combines exceptional design with a lifestyle driven by world-class services. From valet parking and private massage treatments to golf carts and a members-only beach club, every detail is curated for the residents’ comfort. The iconic lobby alone is a showpiece of international design talent, showcasing décor by Lasvit, B&amp;B Italia, and Tom Dixon. The location of Villa Del Gavi also ensures seamless access to Dubai’s vibrant lifestyle while offering unmatched serenity—making it one of the most compelling luxury investments in the region.","price":3600000,"title":"Villa Del Gavi","bitrix":{"id":1180,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Villa Del Gavi","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Villa Del Gavi","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Mr. Eight Development","project_location":"Dubai Islands"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_6e58702536.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_6e58702536.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2983128,"lng":55.2950412},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/